<title>BAHRAIN: Bahrain in exercises with U.S., British forces.</title>
<headline>Bahrain in exercises with U.S., British forces.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1996-09-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bahrain's armed forces are engaged in joint military exercises with U.S. and British forces, the official Gulf News Agency reported on Saturday.</p>
<p>The agency did not give details.</p>
<p>Bahrain has defence cooperation agreements with the United States and Britain.</p>
</text>
